{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/34a0a70cc8cd09416c0207f1ded0912d.poster.avif?t=1773914394\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/34a0a70cc8cd09416c0207f1ded0912d.webm?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/34a0a70cc8cd09416c0207f1ded0912d.mp4?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Chicken Craft</strong>\u00a0 a quirky chicken management game where you take control of a science farm hidden in a magical forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of a super-talented (and slightly explosive) goblin engineer, unlock wild mutations, mix and match chicken parts, and hatch your very own flock of unique chickens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/43645ceb8d685b57777a0c05c8f00185.avif?t=1773914394\" width=495 height=165 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/196cfb2129e90ef853be217414ba5c5f.poster.avif?t=1773914394\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/196cfb2129e90ef853be217414ba5c5f.webm?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/196cfb2129e90ef853be217414ba5c5f.mp4?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take care of your chickens!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Give them your attention, prepare their food, and clean their feathers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/ad3e7d42cb3ea1d3a778e1a5da41e1ec.poster.avif?t=1773914394\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/ad3e7d42cb3ea1d3a778e1a5da41e1ec.webm?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/ad3e7d42cb3ea1d3a778e1a5da41e1ec.mp4?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own breed!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine mutations on different body parts to develop a breed of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/306c2bb16994a385a4069323193ef866.poster.avif?t=1773914394\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/306c2bb16994a385a4069323193ef866.webm?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/306c2bb16994a385a4069323193ef866.mp4?t=1773914394\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage the farm!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, brew potions, and craft new feeds to unlock new mutations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343910/extras/8e436cbfe0499bd76bb5bf0326abd705.poster.avif?t=